@startuml AppLogic
state "AppLogic State" as Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState {
  state "ExitingTower" as Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_ExitingTower
  state "InMainMenu" as Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InMainMenu
  state "InTower" as Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InTower
  state "LoadingTower" as Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_LoadingTower
}

Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_ExitingTower --> Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InMainMenu : MainMenuRequested
Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InMainMenu --> Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_LoadingTower : PlayTower
Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InTower --> Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_ExitingTower : ExitTower
Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_LoadingTower --> Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InTower : TowerLoaded

Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InTower : OnEnter → EnterTower
Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InTower : OnExit → UnloadCurrentTower
Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_LoadingTower : OnEnter → StartLoadingTower

[*] --> Jomolith_App_State_AppLogic_AppState_InMainMenu
@enduml